WEBVTT

00:05:59.163 --> 00:06:03.197
and supplying it to COVAX
and many other countries

00:06:03.197 --> 00:06:06.330
who are short-supplied
in terms of vaccines.

00:06:06.363 --> 00:06:08.530
Another company, Bharat Biotech,

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:15.330
also started developing its own homegrown
vaccine based on the virus,

00:06:15.363 --> 00:06:19.097
which was then an inactivated
virus-based vaccine,

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.730
which has also received
emergency-use authorization in India.

00:06:23.497 --> 00:06:28.930
And then many other companies are also
partnering with Novavax and J and J.

00:06:28.963 --> 00:06:35.063
And there is a quadrilateral
alliance summit in India